> I had 18/02, but I was stung by a scorpion.  How do you prevent
> poisoning, anyway?

You try to get poison resistance. You can do this by wearing/eating a ring
of poison resistance, or an amulet versus poison. Also, eating various
corpses has a chance of giving you intrinsic poison resistance.

Unfortunately, most corpses that grant poison resistance are poisonous
themselves, so while trying to get it, you might get poisoned quite often,
losing strength every time. You won't get that strenght back when you gain
poison resistance.

There are some corpses, however, that have a big chance of giving you
poison resistance, while they're not poisonous themselves. The best
example is the unicorn. If you kill a unicorn, be sure to do it somewhere
where your pet cannot eat it, so it's yours to devour. A unicorn will also
give you its horn, and applying it will solve your strength problems.

